{"id":"n58198-1-8","stage":5,"title":"배역 · 角色分配","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58198-1-8-1","ko":"이 뮤지컬은 배역이 잘못된 것 같지 않아?","zh":"这部音乐剧的选角好像不太对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뮤지컬은","meaning":"音乐剧","explanation":"뮤지컬：音乐剧；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뮤지컬","audio":"/audio/685596769bed2b2a62f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57767","senseId":"1","lemma":"뮤지컬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배역이","meaning":"角色分配，角色","explanation":"배역：角色分配，角色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배역","audio":"/audio/5f2ea24b030465f01ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58198","senseId":"1","lemma":"배역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못된","meaning":"出错，失败","explanation":"잘못되다：出错，失败；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘못되다","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91481","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같지","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"685596769bed2b2a","term":"뮤지컬","zh":"音乐剧","audio":"/audio/685596769bed2b2a62f2.mp3","entryId":"57767","definition":"在大舞台上结合音乐、歌曲、舞蹈等上演的，一种具有故事情节的音乐表演。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5f2ea24b030465f0","term":"배역","zh":"角色分配，角色","audio":"/audio/5f2ea24b030465f01ae2.mp3","entryId":"58198","definition":"电影、话剧或电视剧等中把角色分给演员；也指那些角色。","pronunciation":["배ː역"]},{"id":"907b4e753781c8cd","term":"잘못되다","zh":"出错，失败","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3","entryId":"91481","definition":"事情错误或失败。","pronunciation":["잘몯뙤다","잘몯뛔다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a5031c176166a22c8d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58198-1-8-2","ko":"맞아. 배우들의 이미지와 배역이 너무 안 어울려.","zh":"对啊。演员的形象和角色实在很不搭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우들의","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이미지와","meaning":"印象，形象","explanation":"이미지：印象，形象；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"이미지","audio":"/audio/302bae1279382d2bbaa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49299","senseId":"1","lemma":"이미지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배역이","meaning":"角色分配，角色","explanation":"배역：角色分配，角色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배역","audio":"/audio/5f2ea24b030465f01ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58198","senseId":"1","lemma":"배역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울려.","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"302bae1279382d2b","term":"이미지","zh":"印象，形象","audio":"/audio/302bae1279382d2bbaa7.mp3","entryId":"49299","definition":"心里浮现的对事物的想法或感觉。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5f2ea24b030465f0","term":"배역","zh":"角色分配，角色","audio":"/audio/5f2ea24b030465f01ae2.mp3","entryId":"58198","definition":"电影、话剧或电视剧等中把角色分给演员；也指那些角色。","pronunciation":["배ː역"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/83b4a904ca0faa099bf3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.282,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58198","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这部音乐剧的选角好像不太对吧？","对啊。演员的形象和角色实在很不搭。","你的头发真漂亮。是烫的吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这部音乐剧的选角好像不太对吧？","对啊。演员的形象和角色实在很不搭。","你的头发真漂亮。是烫的吗？"],"answer":1}]}
